# UI layout and print

- Metric cards: `h-full flex flex-col justify-between`. Mobile (`< md` / 768px): `grid-cols-2`, `text-4xl` values, compact `--card-spacing`. From `md`: previous equal-height layout. Net is green; company tax is red/muted.
- Quick-add modal: strict `grid-cols-2`. Equal-height label rows so inputs align horizontally. Do not put helper text inside a 2-col cell.
- Ledger: card list below `md` (`print:hidden`). From `md` and in print: `table-fixed w-full`, no `min-w-*`, project column truncates.
- PDF is `window.print()` plus `@media print` in `app/globals.css`. No canvas, jspdf, or html2canvas.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<Table className="min-w-[920px]" />

// ✅ GOOD
<Table containerClassName="overflow-x-hidden" className="w-full table-fixed" />
```
